  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are phoneme-morphs of the canonical (Agrippan) pantheon through Celtiberian phonology (-os/-anno/-oc/-onos endings, hard c) \u2014 recognizably the same powers, never real Iberian gods. Neutral clans are ancestor-venerators (saints primary); Chaotic invoke the chaos-powers.",
